adminutils.introPage1=   §l§4§kabc§r§l§cAdmin§aUtils§4§kabc§r\n\n§lHi!\n\n§rThanks for downloading §cAdmin§aUtils§r.\nTo get started, §llook for the §r§o§dAdmin's wand§r\nin the sword category of your §linventory§r in Creative mode or use this command on yourself:\n/give @s au:wand
adminutils.introPage2=After that, use\n§l/tag @s add -auadmin§r\nto add yourself as an admin, in order to use the admin wand.\nNow, you can use it simply by §lright clicking or holding\nyour touch screen!
adminutils.introPage3=------------------\n§l§cWhat to do if the wand doesn't work:\n§r* Make sure you have enabled the §lBeta APIs experiment§r in your world/realm/server.\n\n* Make sure you have downloaded §lboth the behavior pack (BP)\nand resource pack (RP) separately.§r
